{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "87469d73205a8dab4075af0c570712808b09d85a645e857d0b63d9e1ea4a405a", "ja": "ふたりのお悩み相談会", "zh": "两人的烦恼咨询会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b1c5b039d0fd3b8065902cb74f726de944db064670e6c280e8a7304b85497155", "ja": "番組は好評のまま終了。かりんをみんなで\n見送った後、まつりがカフェでの打ち上げを\n提案する。次は自分たちの悩みを心ゆくまで\n聞いてもらいたいと笑うふたりに、プロ\nデューサーは覚悟を決めるのだった。", "zh": "节目在好评中结束。大家目送Karin离开后，茉莉提议去咖啡馆庆功。下次想让制作人尽情听听自己的烦恼——面对笑着这么说的两人，制作人下定了决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c72f6a65b4ca9124e039972aa21eecdbee2d6c6f7f97f1b28eb536e3c35796d0", "ja": "（定期公演の公録は無事終わった。ラジオ配信も、\n惜しまれつつ一区切りがついた。そして今日は……）", "zh": "（定期公演的公开录音顺利结束了。广播直播也在大家依依不舍中告一段落。而今天则是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "f663e434d095235353252f4e3007385e344e91b923c95c67d33c389a9fe11f16", "ja": "ふたりとも、わざわざ妹の見送りに\n付き合ってくれてありがとう。", "zh": "谢谢你们俩特意陪我来送妹妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "1f2511b41b60c91917bbe7b98f272d5e8f3edab25cac98507350f4a96698d108", "ja": "問題ないのです。\nかりんさんには、姫もお世話になりましたし……。", "zh": "没问题的。\n而且华凛平时也一直很照顾公主呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "9b71b4bcefb14c0ecc5de2bbc040e421d4c20ef1d1ab1d5186574a6a3debd654", "ja": "けど、すぐに会える距離じゃないのは、\nちょっぴり残念なのです。", "zh": "不过，没办法马上见到面，还是有一点点遗憾的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "22807a340966f04da20a8e8e9d748bcd8e543053ec03e3c94dd9687304827f96", "ja": "そうだな。", "zh": "也是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "6a60e0b14b43abe1fbb03cf7be29cb4526a8975d2c60dff01eda9a319a3b7bef", "ja": "あら、{$P$}？\nだめよ、私の妹をスカウトしようなんて考えたら。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}？\n你要是敢打我妹妹的主意，想把她挖来当偶像，可不行哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "498649ffeaa856eabb6845c058c05c480c44675bb369eb5521ffc6e13390ec0c", "ja": "い、いやまさか。ご本人にその気がないなら、\n無理にスカウトする気は……。", "zh": "不、不会啦。本人要是没有那个意愿的话，\n我也没打算强行去挖人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "eccf08d6b75c490c120f127b389cfb814999b5f3145478af67c4e2e93b939fc5", "ja": "それにしても、まつりと妹さん、\nいつの間にかすごく仲が良くなってたな……。", "zh": "话说回来，真没想到，茉莉和她妹妹不知不觉间已经变得这么要好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9ebf5ac2426d5c39c0e50e379836fa2e43225206ffe18bc6ddc63cbdd763842b", "ja": "今回、俺はあまり必要なかったかな？", "zh": "这次，我是不是没怎么派上用场？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "207af85f0231957272019949663cf3e42c3962bb7bd409d1a590a0cbcc7ce012", "ja": "そんなことないのです。{$P$}さん\nには今回、とっても大事な仕事があったのですよ？", "zh": "才不是呢。{$P$}先生这次可是有一项非常重要的工作哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "15ed982b65981a28dc3a8d4e3b3b73e437622360adb0cb1691b8a78b5c2e5e76", "ja": "このみちゃんとまつりに、素敵な曲を用意して\nくれたこと……本当に、感謝しているのです♪", "zh": "为木实和茉莉准备了这么棒的歌曲……真的非常感谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4cd99ac0472b129d01eec05395dd62c2376adad6938cb9e865f1e0688dd4f2b2", "ja": "そうか。\nふたりに気に入ってもらえたなら、何よりだ。", "zh": "这样啊。\n只要能让她们两个人喜欢上，我就最满足了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a31a64767161d2cdd4bc1ffa94e454b9d089722d08dc28048ebe2a42e06d361", "ja": "もちろん、ファンのみんなにもね♪\n新曲、すっごく好評ですもの！", "zh": "当然，粉丝们也很喜欢呢♪\n新歌可是大获好评哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "2ed3ef48b34c4e497ff75d763ab6c2c69ecd28a02267f311192a4ed5c235c5ff", "ja": "それじゃ、この後の打ち上げは……あっ。\nちょうどいいところに、カフェがあるのです。", "zh": "那么，接下来的庆功会……啊！正好这里有家咖啡馆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "64fb24dfe7f3410c55f9d1f491dfee7a6b58613e9357af72a8be0e5d6b723577", "ja": "あら、いいわね！　それじゃ、今日は3人で、\nお茶を飲みながらゆっくり語り合いましょ♪", "zh": "哎呀，挺不错的嘛！那今天就我们3个人，\n一边喝茶一边好好聊聊吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e5b9dbb8a0addd2fbd5e0a36d6e2cb62d50a52b2f3ecb6632371c3d2ab87db20", "ja": "え？　打ち上げがカフェでいいんですか？", "zh": "诶？庆功宴在咖啡馆真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "2a362d6e09c9851e3bd3a928c5bba0bb7b68637abf675baf5f7bd4204266fcfa", "ja": "ええ。だって私たち、配信で\nたくさんのお悩みに答えてきたし……。", "zh": "嗯。因为我们之前在直播中回答过很多烦恼嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "46141405762e9f6be0c52882784cd5b31d07665feec498ff4da4160bdc87f2ff", "ja": "なら姫たちのお悩みは、{$P$}さんが\n聞いてくれるのですよね？", "zh": "那么，公主们的烦恼，就由{$P$}先生来倾听，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "0e54dab75bea7b5c309c34b20ed21548c1e492fd0b78a9fa537b4f88db39a636", "ja": "姫は、聞いてほしい話がたくさんあるのです。\nね？　……ね？", "zh": "公主有好多话想让你听听呢。\n好不好？……好不好嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "46c3924dd4548e17bda78826c5625e4d8bad90dea32436caf0ec02edfa31ad1b", "ja": "うふふ。アイドルだって、悩みがあって当然だものね。\nさあ、今日は心ゆくまで付き合ってもらうわよ！", "zh": "呵呵。偶像当然也会有烦恼嘛。\n来，今天就陪我聊个痛快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "afee575254d0c85392b0b46fe10b27ca964e4bd6aa5239e081332d3d7111ce12", "ja": "心ゆくまで……わかりました！\n今日はとことん付き合いますね。", "zh": "尽情地……我明白了！\n今天我会奉陪到底的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "70218f1550720deeba1a27618b70a975260519c9c31db6dde776661f8688249d", "ja": "（悩める子羊達を導いた、\n人気パーソナリティ程の実力はないけど……）", "zh": "（虽然还没有能引导烦恼羔羊们的知名主持人那样的实力……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "024640a89814cd63c86658213e669da57739317826f681ce2f466fc81f865573", "ja": "（でも、話を聞く事は俺にもできるはずだ。\n……ふたりの、プロデューサーとして）", "zh": "（虽然我还没有达到那位引导烦恼羔羊们的知名主持人的水平……）\n（但听人倾诉，我应该还是做得到的。\n……作为两人的制作人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
